# 11. CORE BUSINESS WORKFLOW

Implement this complete end-to-end workflow.

## Workflow: Collector to Recycler

1. Collector creates an account.
2. Collector logs in.
3. Collector creates a scrap listing.
4. Collector uploads scrap images.
5. The backend calculates an indicative value.
6. The listing becomes available in the recycler marketplace.
7. A verified recycler views the listing.
8. Recycler makes an offer.
9. Collector receives a notification.
10. Collector compares available offers.
11. Collector accepts an offer.
12. The system creates an order.
13. The listing becomes unavailable for conflicting offers.
14. Recycler and collector coordinate pickup or handover.
15. Final weight is recorded.
16. Final amount is confirmed.
17. Handover is confirmed.
18. Payment is recorded.
19. The transaction is completed.
20. Traceability events are recorded.
21. The Digital Scrap Passport is updated.
22. Both users can view transaction history.
23. Admin can monitor the transaction.

Every step must use real backend and database operations.

Do not implement only frontend navigation for this workflow.

